#----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Filename              :       cttumGo.scr
# Author                :       Mani Kutti
# Description           :       This is the script called by CTTUM 
# Called Script         :       None
# Calling Script        :       None
# Modification History
# Sl. #           Date             Author             Modification           Version
# -----        ----------         --------------    ----------------        ---------
#  1           24-oct-2022         Mani Kutti          original Version		1.0
